":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":391232995,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTEyMzI5OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:assetlib","name":"topic:assetlib","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-09-17T19:37:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T12:52:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on v4.8.dev (97dab7a63)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (97dab7a63) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (3840x2160 @ 120.00 Hz, 3840x2160 @ 60.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.11 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSearching in the `Asset Store` is laggy when updating the search term slowly. This is caused by requests starting after the search hasn't changed for a bit. When a new search is started we first wait for the old one to finish which sometimes takes a long time. During this the main thread is blocked.\n\n<img width=\"795\" height=\"519\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c052e72f-3941-4b0f-bd0e-9fda13a2545e\" />\n\n<img width=\"988\" height=\"599\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fd75fe4-c3ba-435f-9faa-3a6ecae79bc9\" />\n\nI tried forwarding the `SafeFlag` `thread_request_quit` to the while loop in `_get_http_data` which seemed to help but some `get_partial_data` calls take long (>100ms) which this approach doesn't solve.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn `Asset Store` write or remove text in the search field with short pauses after each update, this is somewhat inconsistent but occurs often.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123586/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123586/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}